- Halt! Who goes there? 
- Hi, Crysta!

68
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:26,010
- Okay, what's the password? 
- Oh, come on, you guys.

69
00:06:26,090 --> 00:06:28,760
- Is that the password? 
- It sounds good.

70
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:32,430
- Bye. 
- "Bye." That's it! That's the password!

71
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:34,970
Well, I don't know if that's the 
password or not. I'm so confused, you...

72
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:40,190
Magi? Magi.

73
00:06:43,690 --> 00:06:48,320
Oh, Magi, I just saw the most 
incredible thing above the canopy.

74
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:51,200
