102
00:09:25,310 --> 00:09:27,810
So what did the Mag have to say, huh?

103
00:09:27,850 --> 00:09:31,900
- She said I should get serious. 
- 'Bout time.

104
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:35,570
Oh, and stop hanging around 
with bug-brained layabouts like you.

105
00:09:35,650 --> 00:09:39,240
Oh, no! Oh!

106
