115
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,700
Oh! Gravity works.

116
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,710
[Thump]

117
00:10:34,710 --> 00:10:38,220
Oh. Poor guy.

118
00:10:41,890 --> 00:10:43,850
Oh!

119
00:10:46,770 --> 00:10:50,690
Primary testing laboratory. 
No! Pass the probe.

120
00:10:50,730 --> 00:10:52,900
Graduate students, 
all gather forward. No!

121
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:55,900
- Love the haircut. 
- [Screams]

122
