It's all right. 
We won't hurt you.

123
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:02,870
- He's still a little confused. 
- Clearly.

124
00:11:02,950 --> 00:11:05,330
Hello, I'm a nocturnal 
placental flying mammal,

125
00:11:05,410 --> 00:11:09,000
a member of the family of pteropodidae, 
or Ptero-didn't I. [Laughing]

126
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:11,710
If you can't tell, I'm a bat!

127
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:14,920
Yes, I am. And they used to 
call me "Batty," Batty Koda.

128
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:18,210
- Pleased to meet you. Bonjour. 
- [Giggles]

129
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:20,590
And where are you from?

130
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:23,220
I just blew in from a biology lab.

131
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:25,390
I'm back, and I'm flappin' free.

132
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,680
Let me tell you a story, 
and it's all about...

