N-N-N-No! 
[Imitating Ricky] Lucy!

150
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,710
No, no, there are no humans.

151
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:39,670
- They're long gone. 
- Vanished.

152
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:42,590
Definitely extinct.

153
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:46,430
- They only exist in stories. 
- [Sniffing]

154
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:52,680
[Slurps, Belches] Excuse me.

155
00:12:52,770 --> 00:12:55,810
- Oh, charming. 
- It's been lovely, but I gotta "hoon".

156
