Hey! 
Where are you going?

169
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:50,200
Yeah, this territory 
looks kinda familiar.

170
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,450
Fabulous day in the canopy, isn't it?

171
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:55,870
- Where do you think you're goin'? 
- Mount Warning.

172
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:00,380
[Groggy] I know where I am. 
I know where I am.

173
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:05,590
Hey! You scared me there. For a minute I thought 
