No! Humans did this.

181
00:14:29,070 --> 00:14:32,700
We should stay here. 
It's nice here.

182
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:41,130
Come on! You got a great set of wings. 
Let's just flutter for a while.

183
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:53,140
- [Whimpering] 
- Batty?

184
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:55,140
Batty.

185
00:14:55,220 --> 00:14:57,140
Well, come on!

186
00:14:58,430 --> 00:15:00,900
- My heart! Oh, my heart! 
- [Gasps]

187
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:04,860
I can't go on. Help me! 
My little wings can't make it.

188
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:07,690
Maybe you should wait here for me.

189
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:10,910
This is a fabulous idea. 
I really think we should fly with that.

190
00:15:10,990 --> 00:15:13,780
Only, why don't you stay here with me?

191
00:15:13,870 --> 00:15:16,700
It's okay, really. 
I'll be right back.

192
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:18,830
Why do I not believe you?

193
00:16:02,410 --> 00:16:04,330
[Giggles]

194
00:16:09,090 --> 00:16:11,010
[Moaning]

195
00:16:11,090 --> 00:16:13,010
[Gasps]

196
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:20,390
Take anything you want. 
I won't tell the cops. Huh?

197
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:24,810
- Are you all right? 
- [Yells] I'm fine.

198
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:30,900
- What is going on here? 
- The monster... it tried to eat you.

199
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:34,450
- Monster? 
- My friend and I saved you.

200
00:16:34,530 --> 00:16:37,070
Oh, Batty. Batty?

201
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:39,080
Huh?

202
00:16:43,410 --> 00:16:47,460
Oh, sonic interference. 
What a nightmare.

203
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:49,840
I thought I saw a human.

204
00:16:51,090 --> 00:16:53,590
[Yells] Human!

205
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:57,140
[Gasps] That's a human?

206
