Yes! Kill it! Restrain it! 
Medicate it! Something!

207
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:04,480
[Inhaling] 
Puff up. They hate that.

208
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:07,190
- [Yelling] 
- [Screaming]

209
