Back! Back! 
Get back!

210
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:11,360
- Don't worry! I've got it scared. 
- No! Stop!

211
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:16,110
- I have but one claw, but beware. 
- Will you both just calm down?

212
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:19,870
[In Unison] He tried to kill you! 
I did not! You did!

213
00:17:19,950 --> 00:17:23,700
Hold on! The only thing 
that tried to kill anybody...

214
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:26,540
