in the forest.

215
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:29,290
"Monster"? What monster?

216
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:32,960
The one that ate the tree. 
It was terrible.

217
00:17:33,050 --> 00:17:35,470
Tree?

218
00:17:35,550 --> 00:17:37,470
The leveler.

219
00:17:37,550 --> 00:17:41,390
- Hey, am-am I dead? 
- No.

220
00:17:41,470 --> 00:17:44,390
We could fix that for ya.

221
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:47,020
- Then I must be dreaming. 
- Nope.

222
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:51,560
Aw, sure. And what are you 
supposed to be... some kind of fairy?

223
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:56,110
Of course I am. What about you? 
Are you really a human?

224
00:17:56,150 --> 00:17:58,740
Last time I checked.

225
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:01,080
Listen, fairy, it's been weird,

226
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:04,410
but I'm outta here, 
this dream is history.

227
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:07,040
[Yelling]

228
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:11,710
[Sighs, Grunts]

229
00:18:11,790 --> 00:18:13,880
[Continues Yelling]

230
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:19,590
[Yelling Becomes Laughing]

231
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:22,180
[Whooping]

232
00:18:23,930 --> 00:18:25,850
[Laughing, Whooping Continue]

233
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:29,310
[Yelling]

234
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:36,440
[Laughs]

235
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:41,240
- Check this out. 
- [Yells]

236
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:44,740
♪ I've a basic inclination ♪

237
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:48,040
- [Whimpering] No. No. 
- ♪ A very primal need ♪

238
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:50,210
[Yelling]

239
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:55,050
♪ To inspect the vegetation ♪

240
00:18:55,130 --> 00:18:57,800
♪ For an egg or centipede ♪

241
00:18:59,010 --> 00:19:02,510
♪ I just can't control 
this hunger ♪

242
00:19:03,890 --> 00:19:06,060
♪I just can't seem 
to cut it back ♪

243
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:12,600
♪ On my ravenous consumption ♪ 
